  "title": "Sweet and Smoky Slow-Cooked Pulled Pork Loin",
  "description": "Simple ingredients, including diet soda and prepared barbecue sauce, combine with lean pork tenderloin in a slow cooker to make a big batch of tender, barbecued pulled pork.",
  "authors": [
    "Sarah Meedel"
  ],
  "date_published": "2019-04-02T02:59:39-04:00",
